    "data_quality_notes": "Prior-year development (PYD) was calculated from the gross claims development triangle (Technical reserves note) found on page 24 by comparing the current estimate to the previous diagonal for underwriting years <=2017 and summing the differences. The report does not present an explicit single-line gross 'movement in prior year's provision' amount; therefore PYD is derived from the triangle. The syndicate also records a change in accounting estimates (lengthening of exposure/earnings patterns) in 2019 which materially affected liabilities (increase in total liabilities of GBP 95m) and may distort year-on-year reserve movements. Many class-level run-off figures in the notes are presented net of reinsurance; where only net figures were available (per-class run-off deviations) those are used for LOB movement indications with low confidence.",
